<deviceset name="CH340C" uservalue="yes">
<description>WCH CH340C USB-UART bridge, SOP-16, internal oscillator. For 3.3 V operation tie V3 to VCC=3V3. DTR/RTS drive the ESP32 auto-reset pair.</description>
